    "text": "1 days ago Looking for something useful or fun around Annandale? This week’s local freebies include furniture, garden gear, and even a riding mower. Check out what neighbors are giving away below.\nFREE Outdoor Table Condition: Used – Fair\nSize: 42x27 inches\nLocation: Annandale, VA\nSource: Facebook Marketplace\nA sturdy outdoor table ready for a new patio. First come, first served — the post says if it’s up, it’s still available.\n👉 See this item on Facebook\nCraftsman Riding Mower Condition: Needs service\nLocation: Near Mill Creek Park, Annandale, VA\nSource: Nextdoor\nFree Craftsman riding mower that’s been sitting for two seasons. It needs a belt and possibly a new blade, but it comes with two brand-new extra tires. Great for someone handy or a teen starting a lawn business.\n👉 See this item on Nextdoor\nMy Hero Academia Manga Vol. 1 Condition: Used – Like new\nLocation: Annandale, VA\nSource: Facebook Marketplace\nA nearly new copy of the first volume of My Hero Academia manga — perfect for fans or collectors.\n👉 See this item on Facebook\nTenmat Recessed Light Covers (3) FF130E Condition: New, never used\nSize: 9 x 15 x 14 inches (H x L x W)\nLocation: Annandale, Fairfax County, VA\nSource: Craigslist\nThree brand-new Tenmat recessed light covers available for free. Great for anyone doing home upgrades.\n👉 See this item on Craigslist\nPropane Patio Heater (Columbia Pines) Condition: Working\nLocation: Rose Lane near Columbia Pike, Annandale, VA\nSource: Craigslist\nA working propane patio heater with cover. Propane tank not included. Perfect for cool evenings outdoors.\n👉 See this item on Craigslist\nCoffee Table Condition: Used – Fair\nSize: 38x38x16 inches\nLocation: Annandale, VA\nSource: Facebook Marketplace\nA solid square coffee table , possibly oak, with cabriole legs. Needs refinishing and two people to carry.\n👉 See this item on Facebook\nIf something catches your eye, reach out soon — free items in Annandale tend to go fast!\nPlease note: Availability changes quickly. Some items listed here may have already been claimed, and links may no longer be active. Contact the poster directly for the most up-to-date information.",
